KNOWNBUG libcxx20
main.cpp
--cpp11 --stdlib libc++
^VERIFICATION
^EXIT=(0|10)$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
std::endl resolution requires template argument deduction from
basic_ostream, which fails on libc++-20 because the struct
symbol lacks ID_C_template metadata. Root cause: libc++-20
forward-declares basic_ostream in __fwd/ostream.h, and the
elaboration doesn't set template metadata on the resulting struct.
